2168-
2169-At lines 1435-1440, `entry_adopted` checks only whether a new directory name appeared. It does not compare content, modes, or the complete protected-entry state.
2170-
2171:A sabotage performed two real in-place permission repairs on the rejected protected entry before collection. The complete GC case still equaled the vector with `entry_adopted=false`. This permits an in-place chmod/adoption path to survive the normative comparison.
